  "body_text": "Environment & Consultancies\nInnovative Tools for Environmental Monitoring and AssessmentLDgenX supports environmental consultancies, public authorities and renewable energy stakeholders in their environmental monitoring projects using environmental DNA (eDNA), metabarcoding and molecular biology technologies.Our approaches provide robust, non-invasive data to improve ecosystem knowledge and support informed decision-making.\n            Applications\n        \n        Environmental impact assessments\nBaseline environmental surveys\nBiodiversity monitoring\nLong-term environmental monitoring\nDetection of protected species\nDetection of invasive species\nEcological compensation\nLand development projects\nOnshore and offshore renewable energy projects\nOffshore wind farms\n\n            Related Services\n        \n                 Environmental DNA \n            \n                Population Genomics\n            \n                Bioinformatics        \n            \n                Bioinformatics        \n            \n                Microbial Community \n            \n                Equipment               \n            \n            Case Studies\n        \n        eDNA biodiversity surveys\n    \n        Early detection of invasive species\n    \n        Environmental monitoring\n    \n        Development of targeted dPCR assays for species monitoring\n\nLet’s discuss your project\n        \n        Do you wish to implement biodiversity monitoring, study a population, or develop a specific molecular tool ?\n    \n                Contact our team",
  "metadata_path": "source/en/applications__environment-consultancies.json"
